<Layout title="Warranty & support"><section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Warranty & support</span></div><p class="eyebrow">Warranty & support</p><h1>Support for your trailer.</h1></div></section><div class="wrap"><article class="prose"><h2>Before ordering</h2><p>Your confirmed trailer documents will set out applicable warranty terms and support arrangements. No warranty duration is advertised until those terms are approved.</p><h2>Ask for help</h2><p>Please include your order reference, a description of the issue and the trailer involved when contacting us.</p><h2>Equipment and accessories</h2><p>Coverage and support arrangements may differ for optional equipment. Check your written quote and accompanying documents for the items included.</p><a class="button" href="/quote/">Send an enquiry ↗</a></article></div></Layout>
